cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Uncertainty Calibration and Robustness Evaluation (Section 4.5 reference implementation)"
abstract: >-
  Single-file C++17 reference implementation of Section 4.5 (uncertainty
  calibration and robustness) of a dissertation on hybrid Bayesian tactical
  spatial identification of Wi-Fi signal sources: NLL, Brier score with Murphy
  decomposition, expected/maximum calibration error on adaptive bins,
  calibration slope/intercept, temperature scaling, and degradation curves with
  breakpoint and recovery time.
type: software
